  "worked_solution": "To compute $d-(3e+f),$ we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d-(3e+f) & =9i+7j+4k-(3(-i+2k)+(i+7j-9k)) \\\\  & =9i+7j+4k-((-3i+6k)+(i+7j-9k)) \\\\  & =9i+7j+4k-(-2i+7j-3k) \\\\  & =11i+7k\\end{aligned}\n$$",
